#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/welcome.md:17
msgid "Welcome to the Unsafe Rust Deep Dive"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/welcome.md:19
msgid ""
"This deep dive aims to enable you to work productively with Unsafe Rust."
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/welcome.md:21
msgid "We’ll work on three areas:"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/welcome.md:23
msgid "establishing a mental model of Unsafe Rust"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/welcome.md:24
msgid "practicing reading & writing Unsafe Rust"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/welcome.md:25
msgid "practicing code review for Unsafe Rust"
msgstr ""

#: src/unsafe-deep-dive/welcome.md:29
msgid ""
"The goal of this class is to teach you enough Unsafe Rust for you to be able "
"to review easy cases yourself, and distinguish difficult cases that need to "
"be reviewed by more experienced Unsafe Rust engineers."
msgstr ""

